    "lean_proofs": "import Mathlib.NumberTheory.Primes\n\n-- Prime gap theorem placeholder\ntheorem prime_gap_bound (n : \u2115) (hn : n > 0) : \n  \u2203 p q : \u2115, p.Prime \u2227 q.Prime \u2227 p < q \u2227 q - p \u2264 n := by\n  sorry"
